    'Check a code: POST /verifications/{id}/checks with {"code": six digits, ^[0-9]{6}$}. TS: surge.verifications.check(id, { code }); Python: surge.verifications.check(id=..., code=...). Response { result, verification: { id, phone_number, status, attempt_count } }.',
